# 统一换行：代码/配置按 LF 入库，Windows 脚本按 CRLF 检出，避免跨平台 diff 抖动
* text=auto
.gitattributes text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.silk binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
